                                  :full-name "cljs.math/floor-mod",
                                  :docstring "Integer modulus x - (floorDiv(x, y) * y). Sign matches y and is in the\nrange -|y| < r < |y|.\nSee: https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/lang/Math.html#floorMod-long-long-"},
