                               :summary "When `expr` is not nil, threads it into the first form (via `->`), and when that\nresult is not nil, through the next, etc.",
                               :usage ["(some-> expr & forms)"],
                               :details "This is a [safe navigation operator](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safe_navigation_operator).",
