                                         "cljs.core/for"
                                         "cljs.core/dotimes"],
                              :docstring "Repeatedly executes body (presumably for side-effects) with\nbindings and filtering as provided by \"for\".  Does not retain\nthe head of the sequence. Returns nil."},
