                              :docstring "Munge symbol or string `name` for safe use in JavaScript.\n\n- Replaces '..' with '_DOT__DOT_'.\n- Appends '$' to JavaScript reserved keywords.\n- Returns a symbol if `name` was a symbol, otherwise a string."},
