                                :usage ["(butlast s)"],
                                :details "Returns a sequence of all but the last item in `s`.\n\n`butlast` runs in linear time.",
                                :examples "```clj\n(butlast [1 2 3])\n;;=> (1 2)\n\n(butlast [1 2])\n;;=> (1)\n\n(butlast [1])\n;;=> nil\n\n(butlast [])\n;;=> nil\n```",
